Z||000007||fropuff||12-31-2000||12:32 PM||||I think they are only available overseas.  Look at the steering wheel on that interior.  It's on the right.  Actually, I kinda like the looks of them.  I know, a little ricey, but I still think they're okay.  I really like that custom interior.  I'm not one for liking chrome, so I would stay away from that, but I like them.  Please don't hate me.  <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
